
### ============================================
### REPORTS + DAILY ORDER COUNT + PERMISSIONS
### Ei muuta tietokantaa.
### ============================================

### 1. CUSTOMER_ORDERS-näkymä
GET http://localhost:8081/reports/customer-orders?customerId=51914&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Basic admin admin_api_password

> {%
    client.test("Customer orders report", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200");
        client.assert(Array.isArray(response.body.content), "Expected Page");
        client.assert(response.body.content.length > 0, "No report rows");
        client.assert(response.body.content.every(
            x => x.customerId === 51914
        ), "Wrong customer");
    });
%}

