### 15. Employee saa lukea oman raporttinsa
GET http://localhost:8081/reports/employee/customer-orders?customerId=51914&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Basic employee employee_api_password

> {%
    client.test("Employee report allowed", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200");
        client.assert(response.body.content.length > 0,
            "Employee report should contain rows");
    });
%}

### 16. Report Viewer saa lukea tilastot
GET http://localhost:8081/reports/report-viewer/daily-order-count?from=2025-10-17&to=2025-11-05&page=0&size=20
